extends ../layout

block content

    .modal#uploadHelpModal
        .modalBackground(data-modal="close")
        .modalContainer
            .modalHeader 
                h2 Help and information
                span.close(data-modal="close")
                    i.fas.fa-times
            .modalContent
                h2.header Files
                p At least one file has to be uploaded. When a file gets uploaded, an asset is created. When multiple files are selected, a batch is created.
                
                h3.header Batches 
                p Batches are a collection of assets. Technically all assets have a batch associated with them, but their functionality becomes more apparent when multiple files are uploaded.
                p If more than one file are in a batch, the assets within do not get shown in the big asset list, or in the recents list. They will still show up in searches.
                p This is mainly to avoid clutter when similarly named assets are uploaded.
                p Batches can also be turned into albums. When they are marked as an album, you can upload an album cover and add more information.

                h4.header Batch Name
                p If multiple files are uploaded, it is recommended to change the "batch name" field. This will give your batch a pretty name, instead of a randomly generated one, which is useful for albums and for searching for the batch.

                h2.header More on multiple files
                p When uploading multiple files, it is recommended to not put anything into the "name" field on the upload page. If you put in a name and upload multiple files, every fill will have that name.
                p Instead, leave it blank, and the site will automatically use the original file name to try and generate a more formatted asset name. This is useful when uploading albums, as this will display the song names for each song.

                h2.header Legal Information
                p This is a text that must be included in the video description in order to be used. This can be a simple attribution or a couple of artist links. Whatever the original copyright holder wants.

                h2.header Price
                p If you bought your asset / assets, you can add how much you paid for them. Not required, but it provides useful information. The total price you've spent on assets will be viewable on your Profile page.
            
                h2.header Changes
                p You can change the information of assets and batches at any time once you've uploaded them, granted that you are the original uploaded of those files.
            .modalFooter
                button.button.has-icon(data-modal="close")
                    span.icon
                        i.fas.fa-times
                    span Close

    .container
        .buttons
            a.button(href="/assets")
                span.icon
                    i.fas.fa-arrow-left 
                span Back

        h1.header Upload assets

        .buttons
            button.button.info(data-modal="#uploadHelpModal")
                span.icon
                    i.fas.fa-info
                span Help & Information

        .segment
            form(action="/assets/upload", method="post", enctype="multipart/form-data")
                .field.required.file
                    .fileUploadLabel
                        span.icon
                            i.fas.fa-upload
                        label.label Select Files
                    input.input.fileUploadName(type="text" readonly)
                    input(type="file" multiple)
                p.help Accepted file types are #{fileTypes.join(", ")}

                